From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:25:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 134/144] GreatDANE: TODO-OWNER publisher placeholders, gated
 ARP publisher, case-insensitive Pepecoin check (round 4h)

The Windows publisher name and signing-cert subject remain the owner's
decision before release. module.ver and greatdane branding.nsi mark CompanyName
/ copyright / ARPPublisher with TODO-OWNER comments; the values are
placeholders and are not pinned as final. CertNameDownload and
CertIssuerDownload stay TODO-NO-WINDOWS-SIGNING-IDENTITY-YET.

shared.nsh Add/Remove Programs Publisher uses ${ARPPublisher} when that
define is set (greatdane branding.nsi only) and keeps the stock "Mozilla"
string otherwise. Official branding.nsi is not edited.

trademark_userfacing_check.py:
- Pepecoin matching is case-insensitive
- MOZ_APP_VENDOR and vendor-derived profile/registry paths are exempt
  (changing MOZ_APP_VENDOR would move profiles; it is not changed)
- publisher/company/copyright Pepecoin still fails
- TODO-OWNER is required; exact "Dane" / "Dane contributors" are not pinned
- URLManualDownload must be https://dane.surf/download/?channel=unofficial
- Get involved is https://dane.surf/source/
- official Sync promo and bookmarks stay stock; unofficial uses Dane IDs
- unofficial Customize is absent; Support stays in place of Terms
- shared.nsh ARP publisher is covered

Prepared only. Not built, signed, notarized or published.
